# Bootstrap 5, HTML5 & CSS3 Rules
- Strictly DO NOT use Tailwind CSS.
- Use Bootstrap 5 grid (.container, .row, .col-*).
- Use standard Bootstrap components (.card, .table, .modal, .badge, .btn-primary).
- Keep HTML semantic and add custom CSS only when necessary.
- Ensure forms use .form-control, .form-select and explicit <label> tags.
